---
description: Research Knowledge Capture write rules
globs: knowledge/research/**
---

RKC owns knowledge/research/**. Never invent types or rels. Registered rels are lowercase snake. Writes are fail-closed. Actor grok-bot/research-knowledge-capture. Do not write Article, Concept, or content-media catalogs. Quote text with verbatim true must match the archived source-asset span. Same claim_key merges Evidence onto the existing Claim. Never auto-supersede reviewed|accepted|verified nodes. PR summaries live under research/catalogs/pr-summaries/ and are not OKF types.
